0..67 Comment "// A role states what it needs of the site that hosts it, as a row."
68..70 Comment "//"
71..144 Comment "// The requirement travels with the program, and the offer stays with the"
145..220 Comment "// site. A deployment that pairs them wrongly is refused before any process"
221..231 Comment "// starts."
232..234 Comment "//"
235..304 Comment "// `far` requires the console, and a store of strings under the label"
305..380 Comment "// `store`. A site hosting `far` must grant the console and bind a model of"
381..456 Comment "// `Store` at `V = String` to `store`. `gandr check` of the manifold judges"
457..533 Comment "// each entry of the row against the site\'s `offers`. The migration to `far`"
534..611 Comment "// prints through the console, because code at `far` performs under that row."
612..679 Comment "// `main` itself performs nothing, because its print runs at `far`."
680..682 Comment "//"
683..743 Comment "// - see: `offers.site.gandr` — the site answering the row"
744..814 Comment "// - see: `offers.manifold.gandr` — the manifold placing `far` there"
815..893 Comment "// - see: `corpus/pathological/worlds/offers.gandr` — sites leaving an entry"
894..940 Comment "//   unanswered, and a world the program lacks"
941..1018 Comment "// - see: `corpus/pathological/worlds/rows.gandr` — a print at a world that"
1019..1040 Comment "//   requires nothing"
